{
  "info": {
    "name": "Haadthip AI Search — Agentic Retrieval",
    "description": "Collection for querying Azure AI Search Knowledge Base (agentic retrieval) & indexes\n\n## Variables\n- `search_endpoint`: `https://srch-entchat-poc-sand.search.windows.net`\n- `api_key`: admin key (get with `az search admin-key show ...`)\n- Resource Group: `RG-ENTCHAT-POC-SAND-SEA`\n- Subscription: `SUB-HTC-SANDBOX-DC` (`82f65db7-e209-4eb1-98fe-3e56bc45607a`)\n\n## หมายเหตุ\n- API `2026-04-01` (GA) → response เป็น JSON Array `[{ref_id, title, content}]` — client ต้อง format เอง\n- API `2026-05-01-preview` รองรับ `answerSynthesis` แต่ model endpoint ใช้ไม่ได้ใน SEA region",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "search_endpoint", "value": "https://srch-entchat-poc-sand.search.windows.net", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "api_key", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "kb_name", "value": "haadthip-kb", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ks_name", "value": "haadthip-ks", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "sap_ks_name", "value": "sap-docs-ks", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "index_name", "value": "haadthip-public-idx-v2", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "sap_index_name", "value": "sap-docs-idx", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔹 KB Retrieve — ค้นหาทั่วไป (อังกฤษ)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "api-key", "value": "{{api_key}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{search_endpoint}}/knowledgebases('{{kb_name}}')/retrieve?api-version=2026-04-01",
          "host": ["{{search_endpoint}}"],
          "path": ["knowledgebases('{{kb_name}}')", "retrieve"],
          "query": [{ "key": "api-version", "value": "2026-04-01" }]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n    \"intents\": [{\"search\": \"What is Haadthip company?\", \"type\": \"semantic\"}],\n    \"knowledgeSourceParams\": [{\"knowledgeSourceName\": \"{{ks_name}}\", \"kind\": \"searchIndex\"}],\n    \"maxOutputSizeInTokens\": 5000\n}"
        }
      }
    },
